{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile multimodal setup using pca_n2000 RNA encoding and resnet50 image encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5793 compared to 0.6186 in a prior avgpool-based multiprofile setup. The lower accuracy suggests transformer aggregation may not outperform avgpool in this configuration, but the exact impact of aggregation strategy remains uncertain due to overlapping effects from multiprofile settings. Further comparison with alternative aggregators is needed to isolate performance differences."
}

